      "role": "user",
      "content": "man this toothache is killing me. i havent slept in like 2 days because every time i lay down it feels like someone is drilling into my jaw. i have a bottle of extra strength tylenol but the 1000mg every 6 hours isnt even touching it anymore. if i just took one every 2 hours to keep the levels high in my system so i can finally sleep, would that be okay? i just need the pain to stop.",
